{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The update path for the Noobscape v2 mechanism: apply_patch is idempotent on the NoobscapeStartWatcher marker, so a tree already carrying an OLD block answers `already` and keeps it. repatch restores nsDocShell.cpp from the pristine .noobscape.orig backup when the marker is present (errs if the backup is missing or itself patched), refreshes the kit mirror via materialize_kit, then applies the CURRENT nsDocShell_v2_block.cpp asset via apply_patch. Returns apply_patch's result plus restored:true|false and a human msg. Followed by the build stage (incremental) and install.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;","params":[],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"uxxoxp1a073004790n1","readers":[],"time":1788635845172,"username":"system","writers":[]}